  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Compatible with Cherry MX Low Profile, Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and Choc V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile), User.3=13.95mm square (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 6.00u (courtyard 114.25x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used.")
